		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Massive, legendary dragonkin with a sinuous neck and oversized, frog-like head. One of the Tane, living fey war machines.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 18, <strong>HP</strong> 68, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 bite +9 (2d12) or 3 eye ray +8 (2d10) and burble and whiffle, <strong>MV</strong> double near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +4, <strong>D</strong> +2, <strong>C</strong> +5, <strong>I</strong> +1, <strong>W</strong> +5, <strong>Ch</strong> +4, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 14</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Burble</strong>. Creatures within near, WIS 15+ on turn or dazed.</p><p></p><p><strong>Vorpal Weakness</strong>. Cannot be permanently killed unless beheaded with a vorpal weapon while it is at 0 HP.</p><p></p><p><strong>Whiffle</strong>. Wings create a gale- strength wind within double near, ranged weapons are useless.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
